  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Mature, feature-rich DICOM viewer with DICOMweb/WADO integration and 3D volume rendering. Dual EPL-2.0/Apache-2.0, v4.6.6 (December 2025), 1.2k stars, 359 forks. Complements Orthanc in the MACH catalog: Orthanc is the DICOM server; Weasis is the DICOM viewer that integrates with PACS systems. Widely used in radiology departments and research contexts.",
